T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Keyboard navigation: Use Tab and Shift+Tab to reach every control in a sensible order.) Tj
T*
(Skip link: Press Tab at page load, activate the skip link, and confirm focus moves to main.) Tj
T*
(Focus visibility: Confirm focused buttons, links, and cards have a visible focus indicator.) Tj
T*
